      AudioResponse: Happy
      HasAdvancedSignal: 0
      AdvancedSignal: 0
    - Dialogue: I want to make a name for myself!
      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 07a16ebe9ca74b449aabb5ea5ff298d4, type: 3}
      AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 3538256414719010168, guid: 6b8dd245a4e1d8c48b2809616a868486, type: 3}
      AudioResponse: Neutral
      HasAdvancedSignal: 0
      AdvancedSignal: 0
    - Dialogue: Getting myself some trophies would be a good way to do it! I-I think,
